  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Int, +1 Con\nSpeed: 30 feet.\nSkill Proficiencies: Crafting, Ninshou\nSteel Release: You begin with the Earth Release Affinity.\nKonjiki Techniques: The Konjiki Clan has access to a separate list of jutsu unique to their clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the normal jutsu list(s).\nHijutsu Flexibility: Konjiki Clan Hijutsu can use either Constitution or Intelligence as its casting ability score.\nLiquid Metal: As a Bonus action, you can conjure one weapon (or a stack if they have the ammunition trait) with a bulk of 2. This weapon shares any weapon seals found on weapons you currently have that it qualifies for but dissolves if another weapon is conjured this way.",
